#: 058d7ae0dc9e4d029fbc0870329c8262
msgid ":ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` bit 2 = 1 (EnableBTFLFonts) forces ArduPilot to impersonate Betaflight and use a Betaflight compatible font index for the font table integrated in the remote OSD system. This is required since the goggles do not have an ArduPilot compatible fonts table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:130
#: 04892b7ec7804d3f88a611a853a34d3c
msgid ":ref:`OSD_OPTIONS<OSD_OPTIONS>` bit 5 = 1 (TranslateArrows) use corrected direction arrows when using the Betaflight fonts."
msgstr ""

